<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>But then at length I tried it—</l><l>first softly, to myself.</l><l>As I called I felt like someone sick</l><l>brought back to health.</l><l>The flow of life within me, I’d never</l><l>felt before.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Then as I called on Jesus I felt</l><l>that I’d been found!</l><l>I was so full; I was calling “Jesus!”</l><l>right out loud.</l><l>I’d never dreamed that I could know</l><l>reality by...</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>And now I’m full and happy, so</l><l>satisfied with Him,</l><l>Because He has come and filled me</l><l>clear up past the brim.</l><l>His life is now my portion—</l><l>I’ll go on all my life, just...</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
